      "description": "<p>Bessent, driving force behind US push to cripple Iran’s economy, relocates over alleged threat to his life</p><p>The US Treasury secretary, Scott Bessent, has relocated from his home in the Washington area to a military base after an Iranian threat against his life, <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/us/politics/bessent-moved-base-iran-threats.html\">the New York Times has reported</a>.</p><p>Bessent has spearheaded a US push to cripple Iran’s economy since the start of the Middle East war, vowing “economic asphyxiation” of the Islamic republic through a web of sanctions.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/11/us-treasury-chief-scott-bessent-moves-military-base-iran-threats\">Continue reading...</a>",
